	(text "Daughter board for heimdall-switch: status LED + button, mounted\nwherever the vehicle needs them (e.g. LED through a 3mm hole in\nthe hull). Wire J1 to the main board's J4 (1 LED_A, 2 BTN, 3 GND).\nLED current limit (Q6 + R_LED) and button ESD resistor (R_BTN) are\non the main board, so this board needs no other parts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
